WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Today is a short check, and then a game.

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:06.834
Your child reads ten words from days two, three and four, in a new order.

3
00:00:07.284 --> 00:00:10.941
There are no marks under the words today. Do not help on this page.

4
00:00:11.391 --> 00:00:13.449
Mark each word read right, and count.

5
00:00:13.899 --> 00:00:15.773
Eight or more, go on to day six.

6
00:00:16.223 --> 00:00:21.879
Fewer than eight, do days two, three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal.

7
00:00:22.329 --> 00:00:26.884
Then play the game on the next page. Your child reads each stone, and colors it.

8
00:00:27.334 --> 00:00:34.765
One team says the long sound in day. Color those stones yellow. The other says the long sound in eat. Color those blue.
